---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About PharmDaily: free pharmacology revision for BDS students.">
  <article class="wrap measure page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About PharmDaily</h1>
    <p class="credit">Based on college notes and KD Tripathi's Essentials of Medical Pharmacology. Reviewed by a BDS student.</p>
    <h2>What it is</h2>
    <p>A free revision site for BDS students. Each topic has diagram notes, flashcards and MCQs, and it is built to work well on a phone on mobile data.</p>
    <h2>How the content is made</h2>
    <p>Every topic starts from college notes and is checked against the textbook. Wording is rewritten in plain language and every diagram is redrawn; nothing is copied from the book. A topic only goes live after a BDS student has reviewed and approved it.</p>
    <p>Points that matter in the dental clinic are marked <b>For your clinic</b>.</p>
    <h2>Free, with no catch</h2>
    <p>No ads, no payments, no sign-in. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for what is and isn't collected.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
